# DEFINITION

A Data Mapper translates between domain types and storage representations.

# CONTEXT

An order application stores entities using a representation chosen for persistence.


# PROBLEM

The order model and storage format evolve independently.


# SOLUTION

Use a mapper at the persistence boundary to translate representations.


# CONSEQUENCES

The model and representation can evolve independently, with explicit mapping work.
